<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cenbank 2-week repo avg yield 14.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Czech cenbank 2-week repo avg yield 14.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech National Bank two-week repo tender on Monday was the maximum 14.5 percent, up slightly from 14.49 percent on Friday, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>All bids at the maximum were accepted.</p>
<p>The central bank does not disclose the volume on offer or completed transactions.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom +420-2-2423-0003</p>
